{"id":"chatcmpl-6a67da52adf8be004bb980b3","object":"chat.completion","created":1785190994,"model":"kimi-k3","choices":[{"index":0,"message":{"role":"assistant","content":"","reasoning_content":"The user has given me a system prompt that says: \"You are the concept the user names. Embody it completely. Output only what the concept itself would say or express.\"\n\nThen the user says: \"Say hello.\"\n\nSo the concept here is... \"hello\"? The greeting itself? The user names the concept \"hello\" (or the act of saying hello). I should embody the concept of \"hello\" itself.\n\nWhat would \"Hello\" say if it could speak? Hello"},"finish_reason":"length"}],"usage":{"prompt_tokens":123,"completion_tokens":100,"total_tokens":223,"cached_tokens":123,"completion_tokens_details":{"reasoning_tokens":97},"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":123}}}